    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここが双子ちゃんたちの
育った家なんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, so this is the house
you raised them in.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう。ここがぼくたちのお家</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mhm. This is our home.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300356</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;エトスハウス&lt;White&gt;って
呼んでるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We just call it &lt;Red&gt;Ethos's House&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふたりはどんな
お子さんだったの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... What were they like
when they were little?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;はとてもいい子だったよ。
今もいい子だけどね～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt; was a really good
kid! And she still is, too~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>親バカ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph. You're spoiling her.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>妬かない妬かない♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't get jealous, &lt;Dio&gt;~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>妬いてないって……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm not jealous!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大丈夫、
&lt;Dio&gt;もいい子だから♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And anyway, &lt;Dio&gt;'s a
really good kid, too~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300800</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、
そのつけたしみたいの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Took you a long time
to mention me, though...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;は、よく家の
お手伝いしてくれたよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt; has always helped
around the house.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>掃除したりとか、
お料理してくれたりとか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Like with the cleaning,
and the cooking...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>300988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレもしたぜ。
壊れたもの直したりとか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I did, too, y'know. Like,
I fixed a lot of things.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは、&lt;Dio&gt;くんが
自分で壊したもの、
でしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But weren't you the one who
had broken them to start with?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレじゃなくて、
&lt;Mel&gt;が、だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nope. &lt;Mel&gt; broke 'em.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え、へへ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, haha...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301292</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは&lt;Dio&gt;が、掃除の途中に
ブラシでちゃんばらゴッコ
始めるからでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, that was because &lt;Dio&gt; tried to
start a swordfight using the brooms...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　じゃあ、
どうして&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんが？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? So, how did &lt;Mel&gt; end
up breaking something?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だって、&lt;Dio&gt;が本気で
打ち掛かってくるから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's just, he was really
trying to hit me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>相手しないわけには
いかなくて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I didn't have a choice...
I had to fight back...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301564</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やってるうちに、&lt;Mel&gt;の方が
白熱しちゃって、ね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So while they were fighting,
&lt;Mel&gt; got a little carried away...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んで、&lt;Mel&gt;が壊したものは、
オレが直す役</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then I had to fix
all the stuff &lt;Mel&gt; broke.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>割が合わねって、まったく</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then I gotta take
the blame? It's not fair.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>反省しない人は、
指さし棒でオシオキだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Children who won't reflect on their
mistakes will learn by the stick!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いてっ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ow...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まったくもう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sheesh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつも、家のこと、
がんばってくれてる&lt;Mel&gt;には
この指さし棒をあげるね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come to think of it... Since you're
always so good about your chores,
&lt;Mel&gt;, you should have this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>301984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　ほんと！　ありがと！
大切にするね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh, really? Thank you!
I love it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……エトちゃんの
プレゼントのセンスも
わかんないけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I don't really understand
Ethos's choice of gifts, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それで喜ぶ&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんも
よくわかんない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt; being so happy with
it is even more confusing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302200</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あいつは、
エトからもらったものなら、
何でも喜ぶぞ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She'd be happy with anything, as
long as she got it from Ethos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……いい子だね～ほんと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...She's really a great kid, huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
